flowchart TB
  Text[Submitted text] --> TFV[Saved TfidfVectorizer<br/>char_wb, 3-5 grams]
  TFV --> LR[Saved Logistic Regression]
  LR --> TFP[3-class probabilities<br/>selected class]
  Text --> TOK[Local AutoTokenizer<br/>truncate max_length 256]
  TOK --> BERT[Local AutoModelForSequenceClassification]
  BERT --> BP[softmax logits<br/>3-class probabilities]
  TFP --> Display[Independent side-by-side display]
  BP --> Display
  Note[No Word2Vec<br/>No ensemble] -.-> Display
